{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgsq78aCpjrf2268ECAFq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EC5cJwQi9bZLnv6CWTDmqr","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/private/tmp/h-pVEc1n/README.md","old_string":"- `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.\n- `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the\n  macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real\n  home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in\n  `~/.kimi-code`, which the profile opens.\n\nCodex logs in with an API key from the environment (`CODEX_API_KEY`), so it\nneeds nothing from the home folder.","new_string":"- `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.\n- `codex-sandboxed`: the same Codex run, but its process and shell run under\n  `sandbox/agent.sb` with an empty scratch HOME and `CODEX_HOME`. Nothing under\n  the real home is opened, so it needs `CODEX_API_KEY` in the environment; the\n  ChatGPT login in `~/.codex` is out of its reach. It does not load the real\n  `~/.codex/config.toml`, so that config's MCP servers and plugins are absent.\n- `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the\n  macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real\n  home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in\n  `~/.kimi-code`, which the profile opens.\n\nThe profile takes the one real-home path a lane may open as `-D OPEN=<path>`:\nkimi opens `~/.kimi-code`, `codex-sandboxed` opens its scratch dir.\n\nThe plain `codex` lane logs in with the ChatGPT login in `~/.codex`."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":725,"cache_read_input_tokens":42377,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":725},